1
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:45,040
(Shen Teng)

2
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:47,640
(Bai Jingting)

3
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,840
(Jia Bing)

4
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:51,920
(Hu Xianxu)

5
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:56,400
(Wang Anyu)

6
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:58,680
(Fan Chengcheng)

7
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:00,920
(Huang Jingyu)

8
00:01:01,040 --> 00:01:02,960
(Wang Churan)

9
00:01:03,120 --> 00:01:05,000
(Li Yunrui)

10
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:10,420
=Natural High S4=

11
00:01:14,180 --> 00:01:16,020
=EP5 (Part 2): Night in Huairou=

12
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:17,160
The sky is so beautiful.

13
00:01:19,180 --> 00:01:25,340
(Yanqi Lake)

14
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:27,680
I watched the first episode, Teng.

15
00:01:28,520 --> 00:01:29,120
Yeah?

16
00:01:29,440 --> 00:01:31,070
(Unexpected chokehold)
You said my cooking is bad.

17
00:01:31,440 --> 00:01:31,920
Let me tell you

18
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:33,640
who cooks the worst.

19
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:35,040
Who?

20
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:36,520
Hu.

21
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:39,520
So this is my karma.

22
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:40,600
I caught you!

23
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:43,440
How could I do that?

24
00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:45,800
Is it actually bad?

25
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:49,040
Sometimes.

26
00:01:49,060 --> 00:01:50,820
(Honest confession)

27
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:54,200
What made you confess?

28
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,640
What? Am I supposed to say
it's always been bad?

29
00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:59,520
You can say it's delicious at times.

30
00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:01,560
So how was the first episode?

31
00:02:02,320 --> 00:02:03,840
I was sitting there cracking up.

32
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:04,680
They even asked me,

33
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:05,760
"You're watching"

34
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:06,720
"your own show"

35
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:07,760
"and still laughing that hard."

36
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:09,470
When I was changing pants,

37
00:02:09,470 --> 00:02:10,960
you held me down right there.

38
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:12,160
The comments were asking

39
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:14,150
(Natural High S4 EP1 Part 1)
why you were holding me down.

40
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:15,240
Right in that corner.

41
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,160
We were stuck there.

42
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:17,480
Why were you changing? I forgot.

43
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:19,840
My drawstring broke,

44
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:20,880
so I had to change.

45
00:02:21,480 --> 00:02:22,280
You were covering for me.

46
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:26,960
Let's go.

47
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:28,680
Can you drive?

48
00:02:30,660 --> 00:02:32,100
I'm the drift king.

49
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:35,320
Churan, did you watch episode 1?

50
00:02:35,320 --> 00:02:36,560
I was honestly shocked.

51
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:39,680
I didn't think

52
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:40,600
I was that foolish.

53
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:42,200
Was it Hu? No.

54
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:43,200
Then she later said,

55
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:44,320
"I think it's Hu."

56
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:45,880
Wang Churan!

57
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:46,960
That day, I even wondered

58
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:48,880
if I was

59
00:02:48,880 --> 00:02:50,560
too loud with her.

60
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:52,040
Then you realized I deserved it.

61
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:53,520
After watching the show...

62
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:54,880
You were too nice.

63
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:56,600
I should've yelled at you.

64
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:00,880
Lin,

65
00:03:00,880 --> 00:03:02,560
how many dramas have you done this year?

66
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:03,480
One and a half.

67
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:05,080
How do you do half a drama?

68
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:07,320
I started one late last year
and finished it early this year.

69
00:03:07,880 --> 00:03:09,040
Jingyu, when do you wrap?

70
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:09,800
In a week.

71
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:10,840
Just one more week, and I'll be done.

72
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,080
What's the theme?

73
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:13,320
Head of a security team.

74
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:15,640
So that's the highest rank?

75
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:17,040
You've maxed out

76
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:18,560
at head of security?

77
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:19,920
The security department.

78
00:03:19,920 --> 00:03:21,180
(Gains a new job title)

79
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:27,240
Bai, have you been

80
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,000
on that boardwalk?

81
00:03:28,320 --> 00:03:29,280
Yes. I go all the time.

82
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:32,400
Will the bridge be really high?

83
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:33,000
Nope.

84
00:03:34,040 --> 00:03:35,800
It's just a winding path
up the mountain.

85
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:38,560
From up there, you can see all

86
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:40,280
of Yanqi Lake.

87
00:03:40,780 --> 00:03:42,540
(Arriving at Yanqi Lake)

88
00:03:42,540 --> 00:03:43,240
(West Mountain Boardwalk)

89
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:44,760
Yanqi Lake, West Mountain.

90
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:48,080
It's so cool.

91
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:49,000
Refreshing.

92
00:03:49,880 --> 00:03:51,120
Hello, are you cold?

93
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,280
A little.

94
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:53,520
It's chilly in Beijing today.

95
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:53,920
A little cold.

96
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:55,440
The temperature drops at night.

97
00:03:55,440 --> 00:03:56,200
It's quite cold.

98
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:57,320
Let's go!

99
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:00,800
Did you grow up

100
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:02,480
near Yanqi Lake?

101
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:04,160
Yeah. I grew up

102
00:04:04,160 --> 00:04:05,360
in Yanqi Town.

103
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,840
(Huaishan Roushui)
The Yanqi Lake campus

104
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:08,600
of the University of Chinese Academy
of Sciences is here too.

105
00:04:08,700 --> 00:04:09,572
(University of the Chinese Academy of Science)
Our students

106
00:04:09,572 --> 00:04:10,040
(Yanqi Lake Campus)
Our students

107
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:12,320
live and study in this beautiful place.

108
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:13,860
(Footage sourced online)

109
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:17,950
Thank goodness I wore long johns.

110
00:04:17,950 --> 00:04:19,360
If you need long johns in this weather,

111
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:20,830
what will you wear when it gets colder?

112
00:04:20,830 --> 00:04:21,560
Thermal pants.

113
00:04:22,070 --> 00:04:22,680
Try putting this on.

114
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:23,280
I'm fine.

115
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:24,120
No.

116
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:24,760
Just try them on.

117
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:25,200
Hu.

118
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:26,680
Listen.

119
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:28,280
Is it backwards?

120
00:04:28,280 --> 00:04:29,320
What's with the fuss?

121
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,080
How considerate.

122
00:04:30,880 --> 00:04:31,560
So touching.

123
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,680
Are you touched again?

124
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:35,040
Give him your jacket already then.

125
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:37,160
I radiate heat.

126
00:04:38,280 --> 00:04:39,320
I'll just hop along.

127
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:40,120
(Heats up with exercise)

128
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:42,480
If you don't radiate heat,
you're as good as dead.

129
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:45,400
I think I'm getting altitude sickness.

130
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:46,420
(Actually, he's just overexerted today)

131
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:47,600
You're probably just out of breath.

132
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:49,840
Altitude sickness?

133
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:51,400
Chengcheng.

134
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:54,280
He can't handle elevations
over 15 meters.

135
00:04:55,760 --> 00:04:56,680
Look at my neck.

136
00:04:57,320 --> 00:04:58,600
I need a lot of oxygen.

137
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:03,040
So you can't buy a place
above the third floor, huh?

138
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:04,240
(Not built for high-rise living)

139
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:05,160
Get a basement.

140
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,360
He'd have to live underground.

141
00:05:07,880 --> 00:05:08,640
Can anyone smell

142
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:10,120
the stink bug?

143
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:11,640
No.

144
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:13,720
No. Right now.

145
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:15,120
I can't smell anything else.

146
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,200
Can only smell himself.

147
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:17,440
I'll help you up.

148
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,720
Oh, you're pushing me.

149
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:21,800
(Mr. Huang helps out however he can)

150
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:22,800
I'll give you a boost.

151
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:24,480
Alright. Let's slow down.

152
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:25,800
Slow down.

153
00:05:25,860 --> 00:05:26,720
(The local taking it easy)

154
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,280
Bai.

155
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:27,880
Slow down.

156
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:29,080
Look.

157
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:30,480
He has the strength to push me along.

158
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:33,760
We're almost there.

159
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:34,560
We've arrived.

160
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:38,000
Okay. We can watch the sunset now.

161
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,000
It's beautiful.

162
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:43,520
It really is beautiful.

163
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,600
Beijing's northernmost,

164
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:49,120
Huairou's the most beautiful!

165
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,400
It's really beautiful.

166
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:54,720
So gorgeous.

167
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:07,800
Bai Jingting's right here!

168
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:09,800
So Bai grew up in such

169
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:10,840
a beautiful place.

170
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:15,800
No wonder you're so "bai".
[*Fair]

171
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:19,560
Are those lights blinking?

172
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:20,720
This is beautiful.

173
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:21,640
The lights are on.

174
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:27,920
Bai, look how pretty
that Ferris wheel is.

175
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:29,160
Ferris wheel.

176
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:33,360
I was thinking

177
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:34,920
if I missed the Ferris wheel just now.

178
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:38,000
What's that tower called?

179
00:06:38,760 --> 00:06:39,840
Yanqi Tower.

180
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:43,080
That was built in 2014.

181
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:44,320
A new tower.

182
00:06:45,880 --> 00:06:48,600
And this is one
of the most important trees

183
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:49,680
for Beijing's fall foliage.

184
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:50,400
It's called the smoke tree.

185
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:52,160
(Smoke tree: Leaves turn red)
When autumn comes,

186
00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:53,440
(When the diurnal range exceeds 10°C)
it needs three conditions.

187
00:06:53,440 --> 00:06:54,520
(and with ample sunlight, the red is more vivid)
The minimum temp

188
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:55,960
must drop below 14°C.

189
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:57,480
They need a temperature range

190
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:59,600
of 10 to 20°C

191
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:01,320
for at least three days.

192
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:02,760
Then the leaves turn red.

193
00:07:02,760 --> 00:07:03,640
Here's something interesting.

194
00:07:03,640 --> 00:07:06,000
Beijing has
a deciduous broadleaf forest.

195
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:07,068
(Leaves turn red as trees draw nutrients)
The leaves turn red

196
00:07:07,068 --> 00:07:07,800
(back into the trunks)
The leaves turn red

197
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:09,320
(Like sunscreen for the leaves)
because it needs

198
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:10,720
to reclaim the nutrients before winter

199
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:12,200
and draw them back into the trunk.

200
00:07:12,200 --> 00:07:14,320
So it absorbs from the trunk.

201
00:07:14,320 --> 00:07:16,160
The trunk absorbs nutrients

202
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:18,400
like carbon, nitrogen, potassium

203
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:20,600
from the leaves and stores them away.

204
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:22,160
Then it releases them again in spring.

205
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:22,640
Right.

206
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:26,960
We're also in Yanshan,

207
00:07:26,960 --> 00:07:28,560
which forms Beijing's
first line of defense.

208
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:30,120
That's why autumn arrives here

209
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:33,120
a few days earlier than in the city.

210
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:35,040
Autumn comes earlier.

211
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:36,760
It's so beautiful.

212
00:07:36,760 --> 00:07:39,040
Let me copy. Use your framing.

213
00:07:44,280 --> 00:07:45,200
This is so nice.

214
00:07:48,200 --> 00:07:48,800
Let's go.

215
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,160
Let's set off now.

216
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:55,640
♪The geese fly north♪

217
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:58,680
♪And spring returns♪

218
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:01,640
Huairou.

219
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:03,280
I wanted to give Jingyu my jacket.

220
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:05,000
He didn't want it.

221
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:06,320
He said he's gotten too muscular

222
00:08:06,320 --> 00:08:07,360
to fit into mine.

223
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:08,240
I'd rather freeze

224
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:09,720
than let you freeze.

225
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:15,240
Next, we'll do a mission.

226
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:17,600
Let's have Dr. Chen do the introduction.

227
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:20,480
So here's a fun fact

228
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,880
for everyone.

229
00:08:21,880 --> 00:08:23,800
(Chen Rui)
Back in May this year,

230
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,160
we actually discovered wild truffles

231
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:27,870
(Bai Jingting)
in Huairou.

232
00:08:27,880 --> 00:08:31,000
This is Beijing's first
publicly reported discovery

233
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:33,000
(Fan Chengcheng)
of wild truffles.

234
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:34,280
Black truffles, right?

235
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:34,760
Yes.

236
00:08:34,880 --> 00:08:37,200
Truffles are quite fascinating.

237
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,440
They grow underground.

238
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:40,230
(Jia Bing)
Around five to 40 centimeters deep.

239
00:08:40,230 --> 00:08:41,910
In the fall and winter,

240
00:08:41,910 --> 00:08:42,880
their scent

241
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:44,840
will spread through the soil.

242
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:46,520
Animals pick up the smell

243
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:47,800
(Huang Jingyu)
and dig them up to eat.

244
00:08:47,800 --> 00:08:48,480
Then they carry

245
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:49,640
the spores farther away.

246
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:50,880
So truffles use

247
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:52,040
their special allure

248
00:08:52,040 --> 00:08:53,000
to spread themselves.

249
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:53,520
Okay!

250
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:56,920
Our next mission is called

251
00:08:56,920 --> 00:08:58,600
Vibey Chat Telephone.

252
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:01,040
(Vibey Chat Telephone)
Split into pairs. Make four teams.

253
00:09:01,040 --> 00:09:03,080
Everyone happens to be seated in teams.

254
00:09:03,180 --> 00:09:05,700
(Team 1, Team 2, Team 3, Team 4)

255
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:07,360
Honestly, this troublemaker...

256
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:09,320
Wang Churan.

257
00:09:09,800 --> 00:09:10,760
If you don't have the skills,

258
00:09:10,760 --> 00:09:12,440
why take on such a tough job?

259
00:09:13,260 --> 00:09:15,220
(One more feud
between the Shandong siblings)

260
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,560
That's in the past. It's over.

261
00:09:16,560 --> 00:09:17,200
It's not!

262
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:19,040
Still holding a grudge.

263
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:21,520
Each round, three teams

264
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:22,920
will take turn chatting.

265
00:09:22,920 --> 00:09:24,550
(Three teams play while one team watches)
The remaining team watches.

266
00:09:24,560 --> 00:09:25,960
The first player gets

267
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:26,920
a key vibe word

268
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:28,760
(First player draws a word and acts it out)
and passes it on

269
00:09:28,760 --> 00:09:30,280
while chatting to the next player,

270
00:09:30,280 --> 00:09:31,800
but they can't say the word itself.

271
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:34,320
For example, if the word is innocent.

272
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:36,440
You have to act it out.

273
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:38,000
You can't say that you're innocent.

274
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:40,160
If I don't say it,

275
00:09:40,160 --> 00:09:41,560
how am I supposed to show it?

276
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:44,880
What're you talking about?

277
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:46,400
You're Churan's college classmate.

278
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:51,560
Players must act out
based on the assigned relationship

279
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:52,840
to pass on the vibe.

280
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:54,040
(Wang Churan)
The last player

281
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:56,320
(Last player picks the correct vibe)
must pick the correct vibe word

282
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:58,080
from six similar options.

283
00:09:58,520 --> 00:10:00,040
Say you're being innocent,

284
00:10:00,040 --> 00:10:00,720
and I got it.

285
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:02,400
(Li Yunrui)
I have to pass on that vibe.

286
00:10:03,160 --> 00:10:04,000
I don't get it.

287
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:06,680
I don't understand. Translate it for me.

288
00:10:06,820 --> 00:10:07,920
(In urgent need of a translator)

289
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:09,560
I'm lost too.

290
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:11,920
I was hoping you understood it.

291
00:10:11,920 --> 00:10:14,200
None of us understood it.

292
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:16,800
How about we do a practice round first?

293
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:17,680
Sure.

294
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:19,360
I'll go first.

295
00:10:19,500 --> 00:10:20,820
(Volunteers eagerly)

296
00:10:20,880 --> 00:10:21,680
Pick someone.

297
00:10:21,680 --> 00:10:22,800
So I get to pick already?

298
00:10:22,800 --> 00:10:23,580
(Players get to pick who's next)
Yes.

299
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:24,880
Chengcheng.

300
00:10:25,220 --> 00:10:27,020
(Practice round second player)

301
00:10:27,060 --> 00:10:28,340
(Practice round)

302
00:10:28,420 --> 00:10:31,540
(Distraction music starts)

303
00:10:31,580 --> 00:10:32,820
(Practice round observing team)

304
00:10:35,940 --> 00:10:37,260
(Sweet)

305
00:10:37,260 --> 00:10:39,860
(Practice round vibe word: Sweet)

306
00:10:41,740 --> 00:10:43,100
(Curious)

307
00:10:48,310 --> 00:10:49,160
I'm so excited.

308
00:10:50,700 --> 00:10:51,940
(What is it?)

309
00:10:51,980 --> 00:10:53,380
(Nervous)

310
00:10:53,640 --> 00:10:55,000
The scenario is

311
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:56,800
(Practice scenario: Secret agent meetup)
secret agents meeting up.

312
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:58,120
(Hu Xianxu)
Jingyu, if you need someone to act with,

313
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:58,960
just say so.

314
00:10:58,960 --> 00:11:00,820
(Scenario: Secret agent meetup)

315
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:04,920
May I sit here?

316
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:06,400
Sure. Have a seat.

317
00:11:20,140 --> 00:11:21,940
(We need front-row tickets)

318
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:33,880
Tiger on the hill.

319
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:36,720
Teng's one hundred and fifty still.

320
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:39,600
It's me.

321
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:45,960
Eagle.

322
00:11:46,380 --> 00:11:47,840
(Code name: Eagle)

323
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:49,040
Have you heard about the mission?

324
00:11:56,140 --> 00:11:58,300
(Dude, what are you doing?)

325
00:11:58,830 --> 00:12:00,260
Have you heard about the mission?

326
00:12:00,260 --> 00:12:01,780
(That's too sweet)
Have you heard about the mission?

327
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:05,520
Have you heard about the mission?

328
00:12:05,540 --> 00:12:08,100
(Too sweet, he's crawling on the floor)
Have you heard about the mission?

329
00:12:09,140 --> 00:12:10,420
(Avoids eye contact)

330
00:12:13,980 --> 00:12:15,100
(Can't help but stomp his feet)

331
00:12:19,640 --> 00:12:21,280
His face is bright red!

332
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,560
He's flustered.

333
00:12:29,180 --> 00:12:31,860
(Please don't look into my eyes
like that)

334
00:12:35,280 --> 00:12:36,160
Are you being followed?

335
00:12:37,160 --> 00:12:38,440
I made sure I lost them

336
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:39,640
before I left.

337
00:12:42,380 --> 00:12:43,380
(Dude, you're scaring me)

338
00:12:44,220 --> 00:12:45,340
(Crying over the sweetness)

339
00:12:45,780 --> 00:12:47,780
(Rolling on the floor
from the sweetness)

340
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:48,960
Good.

341
00:12:50,560 --> 00:12:51,880
Anything else you need to tell me?

342
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:54,440
Not really.

343
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:55,940
(Laying on the sweetness)

344
00:12:58,100 --> 00:12:58,900
(Screams and runs away)

345
00:12:59,780 --> 00:13:01,780
(Ahh!)

346
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:06,480
Is there anything
I should watch out for?

347
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:10,200
Just don't let the enemy
see this side of you.

348
00:13:11,740 --> 00:13:14,620
(And preferably not us either)

349
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:15,760
Then we should

350
00:13:16,800 --> 00:13:17,440
stay safe.

351
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:18,600
Take care.

352
00:13:19,920 --> 00:13:20,400
Good night.

353
00:13:26,180 --> 00:13:27,980
(My blood sugar's through the roof)

354
00:13:28,920 --> 00:13:29,560
Here I come again!

355
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:31,720
Here I come again!

356
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:36,440
My face is burning.

357
00:13:39,760 --> 00:13:41,120
I think he's loving this.

358
00:13:42,080 --> 00:13:43,340
He's loving this.

359
00:13:47,160 --> 00:13:48,000
Look!

360
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,600
You exposed him.

361
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:50,940
(A tough guy's feelings
are best left unsaid)

362
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:54,600
So dirty.

363
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:57,320
Brush it off.

364
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:01,080
Chengcheng,

365
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:02,680
based on Mr. Huang's performance,

366
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:04,000
which of these six vibes

367
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,240
do you think it was?

368
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:06,420
(1. Coy, 2. Playful, 3. Sweet,
4. Smitten, 5. Thoughtful, 6. Weird)

369
00:14:09,410 --> 00:14:10,790
Smitten.

370
00:14:10,800 --> 00:14:11,920
It was sweet.

371
00:14:13,800 --> 00:14:14,840
I had to show you

372
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:15,640
my best side.

373
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:20,520
Sweet.

374
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:24,680
Like how I usually smile.

375
00:14:25,520 --> 00:14:26,000
Weird.

376
00:14:26,980 --> 00:14:28,500
(Unbothered to roast him)

377
00:14:28,520 --> 00:14:29,120
Jingyu

378
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:31,240
really did a good job.

379
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:32,440
Look at how happy he is.

380
00:14:32,440 --> 00:14:33,400
(Never seen anything this sweet)

381
00:14:33,400 --> 00:14:34,400
He's elated.

382
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:35,240
He's thinking

383
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:36,640
it was worth coming here today.

384
00:14:39,760 --> 00:14:41,120
I suppose everyone knows
how the game goes now.

385
00:14:41,520 --> 00:14:42,320
From here,

386
00:14:42,320 --> 00:14:44,600
we pass the vibe along
through different scenarios.

387
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:45,680
The last person has to guess.

388
00:14:46,400 --> 00:14:46,920
Got it.

389
00:14:46,920 --> 00:14:48,760
Taobao also prepared

390
00:14:48,760 --> 00:14:49,920
a Magic Magnifier for everyone.

391
00:14:49,920 --> 00:14:51,840
If the last three players aren't sure

392
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:52,520
about the previous act,

393
00:14:52,520 --> 00:14:53,880
they can use the magnifier

394
00:14:53,880 --> 00:14:55,000
and shout "Magnify the vibe"

395
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:56,800
to get important hints from the others.

396
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,440
After the game,

397
00:14:58,440 --> 00:15:00,120
Taobao also prepared goodies

398
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:01,280
for everyone.

399
00:15:02,640 --> 00:15:03,560
Alright. Let's do it.

400
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:04,960
I'll go first.

401
00:15:06,020 --> 00:15:08,140
(First player)

402
00:15:08,140 --> 00:15:08,940
(Secret)

403
00:15:09,580 --> 00:15:10,980
(Sitting this round out)

404
00:15:11,520 --> 00:15:12,040
Teng.

405
00:15:12,040 --> 00:15:14,160
(Vibe word: Secret)

406
00:15:14,160 --> 00:15:14,800
No.

407
00:15:14,800 --> 00:15:15,360
Mr. Huang.

408
00:15:15,360 --> 00:15:15,960
Me?

409
00:15:16,480 --> 00:15:17,120
Mr. Huang.

410
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:17,880
Huang Jingyu.

411
00:15:17,880 --> 00:15:19,560
He's perfect for this.

412
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:21,120
Is it the same word from just now?

413
00:15:21,140 --> 00:15:22,440
(Already craving more sweetness)

414
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:23,240
No.

415
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:25,400
(Vibey Chat Telephone Round 1)
The scenario is

416
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:28,080
a driving instructor and a student
who's failed their road test.

417
00:15:28,300 --> 00:15:32,660
(Scenario: Driving instructor
and student who failed their road test)

418
00:15:38,280 --> 00:15:39,840
Beijing's skies are always so gloomy.

419
00:15:40,700 --> 00:15:44,830
♪One, two, three, four red roses bloom♪

420
00:15:44,840 --> 00:15:46,000
Why won't it rain?

421
00:15:47,780 --> 00:15:50,020
(Now playing: Bai Jingting's A Flower)

422
00:15:51,150 --> 00:15:54,800
♪Placed in a vase♪

423
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:57,840
If it rained,

424
00:16:00,120 --> 00:16:02,000
it'd be nice to sit in the car together.

425
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:05,680
Do you know?

426
00:16:07,640 --> 00:16:09,200
In the four years
of being your instructor,

427
00:16:11,040 --> 00:16:11,960
I've always hoped

428
00:16:13,760 --> 00:16:15,440
to finally ride in a car
with you behind the wheel.

429
00:16:20,200 --> 00:16:21,080
We could go on a road trip.

430
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:24,320
Go camping.

431
00:16:27,400 --> 00:16:28,480
But your road test...

432
00:16:29,880 --> 00:16:32,940
♪Shed a tear for her♪

433
00:16:33,040 --> 00:16:34,110
You took it 13 times.

434
00:16:34,110 --> 00:16:36,990
♪As if it was always meant to hurt♪

435
00:16:37,120 --> 00:16:38,520
What have I done wrong?

436
00:16:39,840 --> 00:16:40,760
Where

437
00:16:41,400 --> 00:16:42,760
did I fail to explain properly?

438
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:44,240
I don't know.

439
00:16:51,760 --> 00:16:53,400
I asked myself countless times.

440
00:16:53,880 --> 00:16:54,760
Why?

441
00:16:57,080 --> 00:16:58,280
Why can't I teach

442
00:16:58,280 --> 00:16:59,640
the student I love most?

443
00:17:03,640 --> 00:17:05,110
I think I must be sick.

444
00:17:06,800 --> 00:17:07,920
Not a physical one.

445
00:17:09,350 --> 00:17:09,920
But right here.

446
00:17:10,100 --> 00:17:11,700
(Big hint)

447
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:15,040
Got it?

448
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:22,200
You conveyed so many emotions.

449
00:17:22,200 --> 00:17:22,920
I can't tell which one.

450
00:17:22,920 --> 00:17:24,310
What kind of state

451
00:17:24,310 --> 00:17:25,480
was I portraying?

452
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:27,180
Self-blame.

453
00:17:30,440 --> 00:17:32,160
We're doomed then.

454
00:17:33,280 --> 00:17:35,000
The next scenario is

455
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:35,720
two strangers

456
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:37,280
meeting for their first hike together.

457
00:17:37,280 --> 00:17:38,060
(Scenario: Strangers meeting
for their first hike together)

458
00:17:38,060 --> 00:17:39,940
(Hiker No. 1)

459
00:17:41,020 --> 00:17:42,080
(Hiker No. 2, Hiker No. 1)

460
00:17:42,080 --> 00:17:43,080
Hi.

461
00:17:43,080 --> 00:17:43,520
Judy.

462
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:46,560
How are you?

463
00:17:50,040 --> 00:17:51,560
This is your first time
climbing Mount Everest too, right?

464
00:17:53,560 --> 00:17:54,400
I've tried a few times.

465
00:17:56,600 --> 00:17:57,680
Still never made it to the top.

466
00:17:57,940 --> 00:18:00,220
(He was looking for Annie last time)

467
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:01,240
But this is my first time.

468
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:04,800
In the face of such a tall mountain,

469
00:18:06,720 --> 00:18:07,760
I wondered countless times

470
00:18:09,120 --> 00:18:10,000
if you and I could...

471
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:13,000
Tone down that sweetness

472
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:13,680
a little.

473
00:18:16,880 --> 00:18:18,640
Was I acting sweet just now?

474
00:18:26,360 --> 00:18:27,360
I keep thinking

475
00:18:27,360 --> 00:18:28,520
what it would be like

476
00:18:28,520 --> 00:18:29,880
if we ever

477
00:18:31,360 --> 00:18:32,360
got the chance

478
00:18:32,360 --> 00:18:33,400
to stand together at the summit.

479
00:18:37,800 --> 00:18:38,960
But that chance never came.

480
00:18:39,920 --> 00:18:40,920
I've thought about it so many times

481
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:42,360
and have tried so many times.

482
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:45,240
Sometimes I even dream about it.

483
00:18:46,640 --> 00:18:48,080
I'd wake up so happy when I dream it.

484
00:18:53,200 --> 00:18:53,960
What did you dream about?

485
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:57,600
You were there

486
00:18:58,480 --> 00:18:58,960
at the summit,

487
00:18:59,840 --> 00:19:00,520
right beside me.

488
00:19:02,840 --> 00:19:03,240
Teng.

489
00:19:08,560 --> 00:19:10,280
Is this really necessary
for a hiking buddy?

490
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:13,220
(Scared)

491
00:19:16,120 --> 00:19:17,440
If it were someone else,

492
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:19,280
would you be just as happy?

493
00:19:20,120 --> 00:19:21,280
The saddest part is that I've

494
00:19:21,960 --> 00:19:22,800
read too much into this.

495
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:32,560
You have never

496
00:19:33,160 --> 00:19:34,160
been happy about this actually.

497
00:19:35,800 --> 00:19:36,480
But it's okay.

498
00:19:37,680 --> 00:19:38,880
Happiness is still happiness.

499
00:19:40,280 --> 00:19:41,560
The sky is just as blue

500
00:19:41,560 --> 00:19:42,280
without you in it.

501
00:19:45,280 --> 00:19:46,240
But with you by my side,

502
00:19:46,880 --> 00:19:47,880
the sun would shine brighter.

503
00:19:52,520 --> 00:19:53,960
Before we head up,

504
00:19:57,200 --> 00:19:58,320
why don't you

505
00:19:58,640 --> 00:19:59,680
get yourself checked?

506
00:20:03,360 --> 00:20:05,760
I'm just an ordinary hiking buddy.

507
00:20:05,780 --> 00:20:07,240
(We're barely acquaintances)

508
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:09,600
Why are you telling me
all this personal stuff

509
00:20:10,520 --> 00:20:12,600
just because we're going on a hike?

510
00:20:12,620 --> 00:20:14,260
(A very cautious hiking buddy)

511
00:20:14,410 --> 00:20:15,840
Don't focus on my words.

512
00:20:15,840 --> 00:20:16,880
It's how I make you feel.

513
00:20:17,240 --> 00:20:18,200
Because the person before me

514
00:20:18,200 --> 00:20:19,520
acted exactly like this.

515
00:20:19,520 --> 00:20:20,440
I said nothing,

516
00:20:21,360 --> 00:20:22,280
and he gave me a whole speech.

517
00:20:24,080 --> 00:20:25,000
Very...

518
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:25,960
Poetic.

519
00:20:25,960 --> 00:20:26,920
Go deep inside.

520
00:20:27,140 --> 00:20:28,160
(Go where?)

521
00:20:28,160 --> 00:20:28,920
Inside?

522
00:20:29,320 --> 00:20:29,720
Right here.

523
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:30,940
(Go into your heart!)

524
00:20:31,240 --> 00:20:31,840
How are you?

525
00:20:32,060 --> 00:20:33,300
(Shen Teng as Real Estate Agent)

526
00:20:33,340 --> 00:20:35,260
(Li Yunrui as Potential Buyer)

527
00:20:36,600 --> 00:20:37,760
I honestly can't believe it.

528
00:20:39,960 --> 00:20:41,080
You're actually here

529
00:20:41,080 --> 00:20:42,160
looking at houses today.

530
00:20:42,160 --> 00:20:45,660
(Scenario: Real estate agent and client)

531
00:20:46,600 --> 00:20:48,080
Someone has already put down a deposit

532
00:20:48,080 --> 00:20:49,440
on that house you've always wanted.

533
00:20:50,340 --> 00:20:51,980
(Is it the penthouse?)

534
00:20:52,040 --> 00:20:53,520
What's there in the sky?

535
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:56,040
But I'm thinking of backing out.

536
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:00,000
So I can save that house for you.

537
00:21:01,480 --> 00:21:02,520
Since you say so,

538
00:21:04,080 --> 00:21:04,440
I'll sign.

539
00:21:05,160 --> 00:21:06,120
I honestly think

540
00:21:07,360 --> 00:21:08,320
we don't even need a contract.

541
00:21:08,780 --> 00:21:12,420
(Fear level +1)

542
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:16,280
Need me to find you
any other properties?

543
00:21:19,180 --> 00:21:21,860
(Terrified)

544
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:23,200
Just say the word,

545
00:21:23,200 --> 00:21:24,120
and I'll make it happen.

546
00:21:26,320 --> 00:21:27,440
What if I went to another

547
00:21:29,160 --> 00:21:30,120
real estate agent?

548
00:21:30,120 --> 00:21:30,920
How would you feel?

549
00:21:33,400 --> 00:21:34,080
I don't know.

550
00:21:35,160 --> 00:21:35,880
I can't even imagine.

551
00:21:40,600 --> 00:21:41,760
I might just lose my mind.

552
00:21:50,750 --> 00:21:51,920
I get it now.

553
00:21:51,980 --> 00:21:55,580
(You get it?)

554
00:21:55,620 --> 00:21:57,680
(Scenario: Badminton partners)

555
00:21:57,680 --> 00:21:59,040
Tonight at 8 PM.

556
00:21:59,040 --> 00:22:00,960
(Li Yunrui as Player A)

557
00:22:00,960 --> 00:22:01,680
At the badminton court.

558
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:04,000
Same as always,

559
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:04,600
Court 1.

560
00:22:05,020 --> 00:22:07,540
(Jia Bing as Player B)

561
00:22:07,800 --> 00:22:09,760
Why are you turning me down?

562
00:22:11,440 --> 00:22:13,280
You're not usually like this.

563
00:22:15,080 --> 00:22:16,480
I sprained my ankle on Court 1.

564
00:22:19,080 --> 00:22:20,080
Then Court 2.

565
00:22:20,560 --> 00:22:21,320
Court 3.

566
00:22:21,320 --> 00:22:21,960
Court 4.

567
00:22:21,960 --> 00:22:22,600
Court 5.

568
00:22:22,600 --> 00:22:23,720
Even Court 6 works.

569
00:22:26,480 --> 00:22:26,960
So...

570
00:22:28,280 --> 00:22:29,840
Can we be partners

571
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:31,800
and keep playing together?

572
00:22:35,520 --> 00:22:36,120
Sometimes,

573
00:22:37,240 --> 00:22:38,280
