575
00:22:45,260 --> 00:22:47,700
(Sweating profusely)

576
00:22:47,720 --> 00:22:48,600
You're over there,

577
00:22:49,520 --> 00:22:50,440
and I'm over here.

578
00:22:51,360 --> 00:22:52,280
You hit it over,

579
00:22:53,360 --> 00:22:54,200
and I hit it back.

580
00:22:55,080 --> 00:22:56,240
But our hearts

581
00:22:57,440 --> 00:22:58,680
have never been far apart.

582
00:23:00,680 --> 00:23:02,680
I...

583
00:23:02,680 --> 00:23:03,960
I feel the same way.

584
00:23:05,240 --> 00:23:06,800
I don't want you finding

585
00:23:06,800 --> 00:23:08,000
