586
00:23:10,400 --> 00:23:11,040
Okay.

587
00:23:12,320 --> 00:23:12,880
Was that accurate?

588
00:23:14,140 --> 00:23:16,040
Very accurate.

589
00:23:16,040 --> 00:23:16,800
Nailed it.

590
00:23:16,800 --> 00:23:18,520
How could you have

591
00:23:18,520 --> 00:23:19,600
that much confidence?

592
00:23:20,160 --> 00:23:22,400
Well, that's how I received the clue.

593
00:23:25,120 --> 00:23:26,920
