594
00:23:28,200 --> 00:23:30,040
Coworkers pulling
an all-nighter together.

595
00:23:30,040 --> 00:23:35,820
(Scenario: Coworkers working late
into the night)

596
00:23:35,840 --> 00:23:36,360
Bai.

597
00:23:38,280 --> 00:23:39,040
I'm doing all the work,

598
00:23:39,040 --> 00:23:40,560
