What's up with that?

599
00:23:42,640 --> 00:23:44,880
It's not like I haven't done anything.

600
00:23:45,600 --> 00:23:47,360
Back at workstation one,

601
00:23:47,360 --> 00:23:48,720
we shared the same computer,

602
00:23:48,720 --> 00:23:50,320
and we did something together.

603
00:23:51,440 --> 00:23:52,760
I thought it worked out pretty well.

604
00:23:52,760 --> 00:23:54,240
But when we moved to workstation two,

605
00:23:54,240 --> 00:23:55,320
