611
00:24:20,360 --> 00:24:21,880
He doesn't want you having any privacy.

612
00:24:23,260 --> 00:24:25,500
(No finding another work buddy)

613
00:24:25,520 --> 00:24:26,280
I hope that from now on,

614
00:24:26,280 --> 00:24:27,600
