623
00:25:06,160 --> 00:25:07,240
My paycheck stays mine.

624
00:25:09,480 --> 00:25:10,160
I just hope

625
00:25:10,160 --> 00:25:11,720
you can

626
00:25:11,720 --> 00:25:13,640
understand how I feel.

627
00:25:16,400 --> 00:25:17,640
Looking back,

628
00:25:17,640 --> 00:25:18,920
I think I gave Jingyu

629
00:25:18,920 --> 00:25:20,600
