632
00:25:27,800 --> 00:25:29,880
By the end, it's just weird.

633
00:25:30,360 --> 00:25:31,760
Even for "travel buddies".

634
00:25:33,280 --> 00:25:34,400
Working overtime together

635
00:25:34,400 --> 00:25:35,960
