636
00:25:36,400 --> 00:25:37,680
It's all so weird.

637
00:25:38,320 --> 00:25:41,000
We're just regular travel buddies.

638
00:25:42,400 --> 00:25:43,400
This is hilarious.

639
00:25:44,840 --> 00:25:45,360
Seriously.

640
00:25:45,840 --> 00:25:47,880
