645
00:25:59,960 --> 00:26:02,160
That's actually a good point.

646
00:26:02,520 --> 00:26:03,960
I'd say it's "profound".

647
00:26:04,440 --> 00:26:05,880
Only "profound" is...

648
00:26:06,880 --> 00:26:08,360
