654
00:26:16,160 --> 00:26:17,720
Wrong. It's not "profound".

655
00:26:17,720 --> 00:26:19,500
(3. Profound)

656
00:26:19,760 --> 00:26:21,080
If I were to say

657
00:26:21,080 --> 00:26:22,600
the vibe I got from Lin,

658
00:26:22,600 --> 00:26:23,880
I'd say it was

659
