663
00:26:31,480 --> 00:26:32,040
Calling the cops.

664
00:26:32,760 --> 00:26:33,640
Call the cops. Now.

665
00:26:34,040 --> 00:26:35,280
Like some kind of disorder.

666
00:26:37,240 --> 00:26:38,760
I thought it was some kind of

667
00:26:39,240 --> 00:26:41,400
