out of guilt,

668
00:26:41,400 --> 00:26:42,400
but still want to express.

669
00:26:42,840 --> 00:26:43,800
But what's the word for that?

670
00:26:43,800 --> 00:26:44,360
I have no idea.

671
00:26:44,360 --> 00:26:46,200
What love? There was no love in that!

672
00:26:46,720 --> 00:26:49,200
He played a driving instructor,
and I was the student.

673
