00:43:15,760 --> 00:43:16,000
Come on.

1122
00:43:16,560 --> 00:43:18,280
(A toast to my great buddy)
Let's all raise a glass to the village chief.

1123
00:43:18,280 --> 00:43:18,840
You've worked hard.

1124
00:43:21,000 --> 00:43:21,400
Thank you.

1125
00:43:21,400 --> 00:43:21,880
You've really worked hard.

1126
00:43:21,880 --> 00:43:22,880
You did plenty of work, too.

1127
00:43:22,880 --> 00:43:24,760
You really worked like a horse for us.

1128
00:43:27,040 --> 00:43:27,720
Thanks, Bai.

1129
00:43:33,600 --> 00:43:34,320
But honestly,

1130
00:43:34,320 --> 00:43:35,800
I still think Northeast-style buns
are better.

1131
00:43:37,020 --> 00:43:37,980
(Care to explain?)

1132
00:43:38,320 --> 00:43:40,640
Like those green bean and pork rib buns.

1133
00:43:40,660 --> 00:43:42,260
(Green bean and pork rib buns)

1134
00:43:42,800 --> 00:43:43,280
What?

1135
00:43:43,280 --> 00:43:44,120
I've never heard of those.

1136
00:43:44,120 --> 00:43:45,760
(Even the Northeasterners are shocked)
Wouldn't the pork ribs hurt your teeth?

1137
00:43:46,200 --> 00:43:47,960
So you're saying these are delicious...

1138
00:43:47,960 --> 00:43:49,520
Wait, did you basically
invent them yourself?

1139
00:43:51,320 --> 00:43:51,800
No.

1140
00:43:52,160 --> 00:43:54,200
I just have this childhood memory

1141
00:43:54,200 --> 00:43:55,560
of eating these buns.

1142
00:43:55,560 --> 00:43:56,720
You can't just go by your memory.

1143
00:43:56,720 --> 00:43:57,760
Maybe you dreamed it.

1144
00:43:57,760 --> 00:43:58,960
You can't just trust your memory.

1145
00:43:59,360 --> 00:44:00,720
Well, I still woke up feeling touched.

1146
00:44:06,200 --> 00:44:07,240
Now you're confused, huh?

1147
00:44:10,400 --> 00:44:11,360
Is that your rap?

1148
00:44:11,360 --> 00:44:11,920
No.

1149
00:44:11,920 --> 00:44:12,920
No, it is a rap song.

1150
00:44:13,600 --> 00:44:14,120
All right, Teng.

1151
00:44:14,120 --> 00:44:15,720
You should learn
about personality tests first.

1152
00:44:15,740 --> 00:44:17,400
(What is MBTI?)

1153
00:44:17,400 --> 00:44:18,680
Can you order food delivery by yourself?

1154
00:44:19,040 --> 00:44:21,200
Do... you think I'm mentally
underdeveloped or something?

1155
00:44:22,840 --> 00:44:23,800
I'm genuinely curious.

1156
00:44:24,020 --> 00:44:25,160
(I'm curious, too)
I can order food.

1157
00:44:25,160 --> 00:44:26,600
Have I ever told you this story?

1158
00:44:28,880 --> 00:44:30,440
Back when we were working
on the Spring Festival Gala,

1159
00:44:30,440 --> 00:44:32,160
sometimes we'd finish really late,

1160
00:44:32,160 --> 00:44:33,120
so we'd stay at the studio

1161
00:44:33,120 --> 00:44:34,480
instead of going home.

1162
00:44:34,480 --> 00:44:36,640
Then we'd wake up around noon
the next day

1163
00:44:36,640 --> 00:44:37,640
and order food delivery.

1164
00:44:37,640 --> 00:44:39,440
I was only wearing pajama pants.

1165
00:44:39,440 --> 00:44:40,720
The delivery guy

1166
00:44:40,720 --> 00:44:41,600
showed up and knocked on the door.

1167
00:44:41,600 --> 00:44:42,760
So I opened it like this,

1168
00:44:42,760 --> 00:44:44,280
reached around from behind the door,

1169
00:44:44,280 --> 00:44:45,880
and when I reached for the food,
he grabbed my hand.

1170
00:44:45,880 --> 00:44:46,920
He said, "Don't worry, Teng,"

1171
00:44:46,920 --> 00:44:48,100
(Reenacting the incident)
"I won't tell anyone."

1172
00:44:49,400 --> 00:44:50,360
Wait, weren't you naked?

1173
00:44:50,880 --> 00:44:51,720
I was hiding behind the door.

1174
00:44:51,720 --> 00:44:53,360
No point getting dressed.
He couldn't see me anyway.

1175
00:44:53,380 --> 00:44:55,800
(No point getting dressed?)

1176
00:44:55,800 --> 00:44:57,000
Were you sure he couldn't see you?

1177
00:44:58,400 --> 00:45:00,280
But he recognized you just
by touching your hand.

1178
00:45:00,280 --> 00:45:01,600
He must be a huge fan.

1179
00:45:08,800 --> 00:45:09,760
Lost in thought again?

1180
00:45:09,940 --> 00:45:11,200
(Food coma kicking in)

1181
00:45:11,200 --> 00:45:12,080
Hold on.

1182
00:45:12,960 --> 00:45:13,960
I know you're calling me,

1183
00:45:13,960 --> 00:45:15,600
but I'm having trouble
coming back to reality.

1184
00:45:17,880 --> 00:45:18,960
Maybe she's making a phone call.

1185
00:45:21,680 --> 00:45:23,120
I should've worn sweatpants today.

1186
00:45:25,120 --> 00:45:26,000
I can barely squat now.

1187
00:45:27,040 --> 00:45:27,640
I'm stuffed.

1188
00:45:28,680 --> 00:45:29,680
The fire's gone out.

1189
00:45:29,680 --> 00:45:30,480
I don't know about the others.

1190
00:45:30,480 --> 00:45:31,680
I'm done eating.

1191
00:45:31,680 --> 00:45:33,000
Are you coming over here?

1192
00:45:33,000 --> 00:45:33,760
I'm good.

1193
00:45:34,360 --> 00:45:35,320
We're all full and satisfied.

1194
00:45:35,320 --> 00:45:37,000
Let's get some rest early tonight.

1195
00:45:42,060 --> 00:45:43,260
(Natural High 4 Mission Card)
Here's your mission!

1196
00:45:43,310 --> 00:45:45,040
(Wang Churan, Oreo Brand Sharing Ambassador)
Shoot a creative, playful photo series.

1197
00:45:46,070 --> 00:45:46,480
Got it!

1198
00:45:47,190 --> 00:45:47,900
(Crispy and crunchy)
Twist it open.

1199
00:45:48,760 --> 00:45:49,960
Let the fun begin!

1200
00:45:51,910 --> 00:45:53,500
(Sweet but not too sweet)
Lick it.

1201
00:45:53,500 --> 00:45:54,510
Smooth, creamy filling.

1202
00:45:55,470 --> 00:45:56,450
A sweet sensation!

1203
00:45:57,870 --> 00:45:58,980
Dunk it.

1204
00:45:59,350 --> 00:46:00,230
Take the taste to the next level.

1205
00:46:01,060 --> 00:46:01,910
That works too!

1206
00:46:01,910 --> 00:46:02,720
Unleash your playful side.

1207
00:46:02,880 --> 00:46:03,680
Anything goes!

1208
00:46:04,690 --> 00:46:06,270
100% imported cocoa powder.

1209
00:46:06,430 --> 00:46:07,770
Multiple layers of deliciousness
in every bite.

1210
00:46:08,280 --> 00:46:09,240
Bring along Oreo.

1211
00:46:09,240 --> 00:46:10,710
Let's head out and have some fun
together!

1212
00:46:10,930 --> 00:46:12,160
Oreo, delicious and fun!

1213
00:46:22,500 --> 00:46:23,900
(Keeping my buddies close to my heart)

1214
00:46:27,880 --> 00:46:29,360
Why have you been dressing
so normally lately?

1215
00:46:29,500 --> 00:46:30,080
(Daily Bai OOTD inspection)

1216
00:46:30,080 --> 00:46:31,560
I'm back in my hometown.

1217
00:46:32,280 --> 00:46:33,720
Don't want to give the locals something
to gossip about?

1218
00:46:33,720 --> 00:46:34,160
Is that it?

1219
00:46:34,680 --> 00:46:36,600
We've gradually gotten used
to your style,

1220
00:46:36,600 --> 00:46:37,480
but then suddenly,

1221
00:46:38,040 --> 00:46:38,680
you went back

1222
00:46:38,680 --> 00:46:39,400
to being a normal person.

1223
00:46:39,400 --> 00:46:40,040
Normal.

1224
00:46:41,960 --> 00:46:43,840
Next, we've got a new game.

1225
00:46:43,840 --> 00:46:44,360
It's called...

1226
00:46:44,360 --> 00:46:45,960
(Lyric Chase)

1227
00:46:45,960 --> 00:46:47,040
All eight members will have a

1228
00:46:47,040 --> 00:46:50,360
(Lyric Chase)
complete song lyric attached to their backs.

1229
00:46:50,360 --> 00:46:51,720
Everyone must figure out a way

1230
00:46:51,720 --> 00:46:53,280
to read the lyrics
on the other players' backs.

1231
00:46:53,640 --> 00:46:55,720
Then go to the round platform
and pick up a microphone.

1232
00:46:55,720 --> 00:46:57,280
(Platform, microphone)
Sing the lyrics on that person's back.

1233
00:46:57,280 --> 00:46:59,360
That player will then be eliminated.

1234
00:46:59,960 --> 00:47:00,360
Of course,

1235
00:47:00,360 --> 00:47:01,120
on this trip,

1236
00:47:01,120 --> 00:47:03,240
we also have a great partner joining us.

1237
00:47:03,240 --> 00:47:04,280
The brand that goes with everything,

1238
00:47:04,280 --> 00:47:06,000
China's leading nutrition brand, Yili.

1239
00:47:06,360 --> 00:47:07,840
Helping everyone keep the fun going.

1240
00:47:08,080 --> 00:47:08,880
Let's set off with Yili!

1241
00:47:10,040 --> 00:47:11,040
What's the plan today?

1242
00:47:11,040 --> 00:47:12,440
A fun game. Let's play!

1243
00:47:13,000 --> 00:47:13,440
Sure!

1244
00:47:14,680 --> 00:47:16,640
Everyone, close your eyes.
We're putting the lyrics on your backs.

1245
00:47:17,080 --> 00:47:17,960
(Sit still, Dumb)
We're attaching the lyrics now.

1246
00:47:17,960 --> 00:47:19,320
Once I say open your eyes,
the game has already started.

1247
00:47:25,200 --> 00:47:25,880
What?

1248
00:47:25,880 --> 00:47:27,360
The head coach is warming up.

1249
00:47:29,280 --> 00:47:30,400
Getting nervous?

1250
00:47:30,400 --> 00:47:31,080
Ready?

1251
00:47:31,960 --> 00:47:32,440
Come on.

1252
00:47:33,200 --> 00:47:33,680
Come on.

1253
00:47:35,320 --> 00:47:35,800
Come on.

1254
00:47:35,800 --> 00:47:36,500
(Smoothly linking arms)

1255
00:47:36,540 --> 00:47:39,380
(Picking the strongest teammate)

1256
00:47:39,400 --> 00:47:40,960
This game is all
about physical strength.

1257
00:47:40,960 --> 00:47:42,520
Look at Teng holding onto Jingyu.

1258
00:47:42,520 --> 00:47:43,680
He's holding on so tight.

1259
00:47:44,360 --> 00:47:45,840
(Locked in)
You couldn't pry them apart.

1260
00:47:47,200 --> 00:47:49,040
(Making his pitch)
Only our lats

1261
00:47:49,040 --> 00:47:49,800
are perfectly matched.

1262
00:47:50,420 --> 00:47:52,180
(Copy and paste)

1263
00:47:52,820 --> 00:47:53,780
(Applying to join this family)

1264
00:47:54,240 --> 00:47:55,360
Now we've got three strong contenders.

1265
00:47:58,920 --> 00:47:59,760
Who are you taking out first?

1266
00:47:59,760 --> 00:48:00,200
You decide.

1267
00:48:00,880 --> 00:48:01,680
Who goes first?

1268
00:48:01,700 --> 00:48:03,660
(Who's the first target?)
Draw a number for each of us.

1269
00:48:03,680 --> 00:48:04,640
We'll try our best to follow it.

1270
00:48:06,780 --> 00:48:08,060
(Recruiting)

1271
00:48:08,100 --> 00:48:10,580
(New member)

1272
00:48:12,540 --> 00:48:14,640
(The team keeps growing)
These four little guys...

1273
00:48:15,020 --> 00:48:16,500
(One backbend and she's in)

1274
00:48:16,800 --> 00:48:18,540
(New member +1)
I suddenly feel like

1275
00:48:18,560 --> 00:48:19,720
(New member +1)
doing something.

1276
00:48:20,160 --> 00:48:21,640
Hey, what's this...

1277
00:48:21,640 --> 00:48:22,880
What is going on?

1278
00:48:23,460 --> 00:48:25,980
(Instantly become one big happy family)

1279
00:48:26,440 --> 00:48:27,280
All right, close your eyes.

1280
00:48:30,340 --> 00:48:34,460
(Attaching the lyrics)

1281
00:48:36,320 --> 00:48:37,280
Jingyu, Bai.

1282
00:48:37,500 --> 00:48:39,660
(Call received)
Pairing...

1283
00:48:39,700 --> 00:48:41,420
(First to connect)
Connection successful.

1284
00:48:44,600 --> 00:48:45,960
Who has perfume on?

1285
00:48:45,960 --> 00:48:47,020
(Mr. Huang has a distinctive scent)

1286
00:48:47,060 --> 00:48:48,300
(Something's not right)

1287
00:48:48,340 --> 00:48:49,480
(Fending him off)

1288
00:48:49,480 --> 00:48:50,080
Three.

1289
00:48:50,660 --> 00:48:51,560
(Using the chair as cover)

1290
00:48:51,560 --> 00:48:52,160
Two.

1291
00:48:52,600 --> 00:48:53,160
One.

1292
00:48:53,840 --> 00:48:54,360
Open your eyes.

1293
00:48:54,500 --> 00:48:56,180
(Lyric Chase)

1294
00:49:01,920 --> 00:49:03,440
Li Yunrui, you can open your eyes now.

1295
00:49:03,440 --> 00:49:03,960
Li Yunrui!

1296
00:49:03,980 --> 00:49:04,800
(Can't you see those big,
sparkling eyes?)

1297
00:49:04,800 --> 00:49:05,760
Thanks for the reminder.

1298
00:49:10,240 --> 00:49:10,960
Just gonna lean.

1299
00:49:11,700 --> 00:49:12,900
(Waiting for an opening)

1300
00:49:13,060 --> 00:49:14,220
(Launching a surprise attack)

1301
00:49:15,980 --> 00:49:17,140
(Completely oblivious)

1302
00:49:22,320 --> 00:49:23,520
Get him for me!

1303
00:49:24,760 --> 00:49:25,400
Wait, no.

1304
00:49:25,400 --> 00:49:25,920
Bing!

1305
00:49:25,920 --> 00:49:27,720
Keep him trapped inside!

1306
00:49:27,720 --> 00:49:28,400
Bing, don't move!

1307
00:49:28,420 --> 00:49:30,020
(Danger)

1308
00:49:34,700 --> 00:49:35,380
(I'm making a run for it)

1309
00:49:35,460 --> 00:49:36,700
(You aren't going anywhere)

1310
00:49:36,940 --> 00:49:38,100
(Grabbed in one move)

1311
00:49:38,300 --> 00:49:40,340
(A sudden loss of balance)

1312
00:49:43,100 --> 00:49:44,500
(Tracking the target)

1313
00:49:48,940 --> 00:49:50,220
(Charging ahead, getting dragged along)

1314
00:49:50,820 --> 00:49:53,700
(Following close behind)

1315
00:49:53,780 --> 00:49:54,980
(Don't worry, Teng. I've got you)

1316
00:49:55,980 --> 00:49:57,340
(Chasing with all his might)

1317
00:49:59,300 --> 00:50:01,340
(Bai, maybe we should just give up)

1318
00:50:03,600 --> 00:50:05,160
My old footwork isn't cutting it.

1319
00:50:05,160 --> 00:50:05,720
I just...

1320
00:50:07,580 --> 00:50:09,140
(Slow down)

1321
00:50:12,180 --> 00:50:14,340
(Warm-up over. Temporary ceasefire)

1322
00:50:17,940 --> 00:50:19,820
(You little rascal)

1323
00:50:24,460 --> 00:50:25,900
(Here's my chance)

1324
00:50:25,940 --> 00:50:27,780
(Calling for backup)

1325
00:50:30,220 --> 00:50:31,820
(More and more people are joining the attack)

1326
00:50:31,900 --> 00:50:33,620
(Keeping a close eye on him)

1327
00:50:34,160 --> 00:50:35,680
I'm calling the cops!

1328
00:50:36,700 --> 00:50:38,060
(No one can save you now)

1329
00:50:38,100 --> 00:50:40,140
(Completely blocking his view)

1330
00:50:40,720 --> 00:50:41,360
Pin him down!

1331
00:50:41,620 --> 00:50:42,780
(Think you can get away? Not a chance)

1332
00:50:44,260 --> 00:50:46,620
(If I'm going down,
we're all going down)

1333
00:50:47,000 --> 00:50:47,760
My rope!

1334
00:50:48,700 --> 00:50:49,980
(Keeping each other in check)
My rope!

1335
00:50:50,660 --> 00:50:51,980
(Hey)

1336
00:50:52,420 --> 00:50:53,860
(Got you! I am here to help)

1337
00:50:57,260 --> 00:50:58,620
(The rope comes loose)

1338
00:50:59,580 --> 00:51:00,780
(Just joining in on the fun)

1339
00:51:01,740 --> 00:51:03,540
(Trying to pry their hands apart)

1340
00:51:05,320 --> 00:51:05,920
Why?

1341
00:51:06,540 --> 00:51:09,060
(Escaping the encirclement)

1342
00:51:09,100 --> 00:51:11,020
(Reached today's stamina limit)

1343
00:51:12,220 --> 00:51:13,780
(Let me lie down for a bit)

1344
00:51:13,980 --> 00:51:16,740
(Abandoned)

1345
00:51:21,260 --> 00:51:23,500
(Gonna lie down. I'm tired)

1346
00:51:27,920 --> 00:51:28,760
Teng, that's a good idea.

1347
00:51:28,760 --> 00:51:30,020
(On high alert)

1348
00:51:31,500 --> 00:51:32,900
(Learning from a former teammate)

1349
00:51:34,720 --> 00:51:35,280
Let's team up.

1350
00:51:35,460 --> 00:51:36,420
(Team up?)

1351
00:51:37,000 --> 00:51:37,560
Team up.

1352
00:51:37,960 --> 00:51:38,720
Show my loyalty.

1353
00:51:38,720 --> 00:51:39,360
(At your service, boss)

1354
00:51:39,360 --> 00:51:40,280
Boss, you go first.

1355
00:51:40,280 --> 00:51:41,120
You can have a taste first.

1356
00:51:42,040 --> 00:51:43,240
Off to prove my loyalty.

1357
00:51:45,540 --> 00:51:48,220
(That's what a good underling should do)

1358
00:51:49,100 --> 00:51:51,260
(Showing my loyalty over here too)

1359
00:51:51,440 --> 00:51:52,240
I don't wanna offend anyone.

1360
00:51:53,060 --> 00:51:54,820
(At the service of both bosses)

1361
00:51:55,280 --> 00:51:57,080
Well, since you're doing that,
let me show you mine too.

1362
00:51:59,080 --> 00:52:00,120
What are you doing?

1363
00:52:00,120 --> 00:52:01,680
You can't even pull it off me.

1364
00:52:02,260 --> 00:52:05,400
(Sneak attack)

1365
00:52:05,400 --> 00:52:07,430
(Failed sneak attack. Got pinned instead)
See? I've got you under control now.

1366
00:52:07,440 --> 00:52:07,720
Quick!

1367
00:52:07,960 --> 00:52:09,480
Someone go check on Teng!

1368
00:52:09,480 --> 00:52:10,320
I've got his hand.

1369
00:52:10,320 --> 00:52:11,120
He can't get away.

1370
00:52:13,700 --> 00:52:14,940
Help me!

1371
00:52:15,300 --> 00:52:16,500
(Help me)

1372
00:52:19,020 --> 00:52:20,420
(Take it easy, Teng)

1373
00:52:23,520 --> 00:52:24,800
Were you looking at mine?

1374
00:52:25,680 --> 00:52:26,800
I couldn't see clearly.

1375
00:52:27,420 --> 00:52:28,100
(Completely off guard)

1376
00:52:28,100 --> 00:52:29,140
(Now's my chance)

1377
00:52:29,500 --> 00:52:31,300
(Attack)
Watch out, reversing!

1378
00:52:31,460 --> 00:52:35,570
Watch out, reversing!

1379
00:52:36,660 --> 00:52:38,060
(Handed it to him on a plate)

1380
00:52:41,640 --> 00:52:43,680
Why did you let me see yours, Bai?

1381
00:52:44,520 --> 00:52:45,160
To show my loyalty.

1382
00:52:45,160 --> 00:52:45,980
(Learning on the fly)

1383
00:52:49,220 --> 00:52:51,060
(At your service, boss)

1384
00:52:51,080 --> 00:52:51,680
Boss.

1385
00:52:51,680 --> 00:52:52,820
(Your underling is always ready)

1386
00:52:53,120 --> 00:52:53,720
Who should we take out?

1387
00:52:53,720 --> 00:52:54,620
(Let's get this fight started)

1388
