01:03:04,480 --> 01:03:05,120
Come on, Lin.

1654
01:03:05,120 --> 01:03:06,800
It's almost time to say goodbye.

1655
01:03:06,800 --> 01:03:08,800
Share a few thoughts with everyone.

1656
01:03:09,520 --> 01:03:10,120
I can't keep it short.

1657
01:03:11,240 --> 01:03:12,480
Two sentences won't be enough.

1658
01:03:12,840 --> 01:03:13,880
If you were going to ask,

1659
01:03:13,880 --> 01:03:15,880
you should've asked
before the wrestling.

1660
01:03:15,880 --> 01:03:18,000
He might've had something nice to say.

1661
01:03:18,000 --> 01:03:19,360
Why would you do this to him?

1662
01:03:21,520 --> 01:03:22,320
Let's go on more adventures.

1663
01:03:22,800 --> 01:03:23,200
Right.

1664
01:03:23,800 --> 01:03:25,320
I'll come back next time.

1665
01:03:25,880 --> 01:03:27,320
Great!

1666
01:03:27,320 --> 01:03:30,880
I'll definitely be back!

1667
01:04:43,160 --> 01:04:44,520
(Next episode preview)
The DJ can't catch the beat.

1668
01:04:44,520 --> 01:04:46,880
Let's welcome our most
unpredictable little guy,

1669
01:04:46,880 --> 01:04:47,680
Song Yaxuan!

1670
01:04:49,620 --> 01:04:51,040
Dance Party: Clueless Killer.

1671
01:04:51,040 --> 01:04:52,040
(Boss: Secretly assigns a target)
The boss and the killer

1672
01:04:52,040 --> 01:04:53,440
(Killer: Finds and kills the target)
must use set gestures

1673
01:04:53,440 --> 01:04:54,520
to recognize each other.

1674
01:04:54,520 --> 01:04:56,000
The good guys must dance

1675
01:04:56,000 --> 01:04:57,320
to shake off all their stickers.

1676
01:04:58,080 --> 01:04:59,440
Is this a shower-themed party?

1677
01:04:59,860 --> 01:05:00,440
(Scrubbing)

1678
01:05:00,440 --> 01:05:02,280
(Washing)
Everyone looks like they're bathing.

1679
01:05:02,640 --> 01:05:03,640
Honestly, it's hard to find.

1680
01:05:04,720 --> 01:05:06,120
What the heck?

1681
01:05:06,120 --> 01:05:07,640
(Five bosses)
I feel like I have five bosses.

1682
01:05:07,640 --> 01:05:09,580
(Total chaos)
I can't find my real boss.

1683
01:05:09,620 --> 01:05:11,020
(Trying to match the secret gestures)

1684
01:05:11,060 --> 01:05:12,340
(Look at me)

1685
01:05:12,540 --> 01:05:14,060
(Boss not identified)

1686
01:05:14,100 --> 01:05:15,780
(Trying to identify each other again)

1687
01:05:16,880 --> 01:05:17,880
Who says Chinese entertainers
can't dance in sync?

1688
01:05:18,140 --> 01:05:19,160
(Boss not identified*2)

1689
01:05:19,160 --> 01:05:20,220
(Where's the boss?)
Who?

1690
01:05:20,540 --> 01:05:21,860
(You foolish subordinate)

1691
01:05:22,060 --> 01:05:23,260
(Trying hard to recognize each other)

1692
01:05:24,260 --> 01:05:26,140
(Get out of the way!)

1693
01:05:26,220 --> 01:05:27,380
(I'm out of ideas)

1694
01:05:27,540 --> 01:05:29,040
Undercover Werewolf.

1695
01:05:29,040 --> 01:05:30,320
Killer Zero can

1696
01:05:30,320 --> 01:05:31,360
infect any innocent player

1697
01:05:31,360 --> 01:05:32,320
to turn them into Killer One.

1698
01:05:32,320 --> 01:05:33,480
The game begins!

1699
01:05:33,480 --> 01:05:34,040
Killer,

1700
01:05:34,040 --> 01:05:35,020
(A 33-year-old job seeker)
infect me!

1701
01:05:35,540 --> 01:05:36,120
(Secretly observing)

1702
01:05:36,120 --> 01:05:36,600
Bing,

1703
01:05:36,600 --> 01:05:37,280
are you the killer?

1704
01:05:37,420 --> 01:05:38,160
(Desperate to join)
Infect me.

1705
01:05:38,160 --> 01:05:38,800
Is it you?

1706
01:05:38,800 --> 01:05:39,800
Hurry up and infect me.

1707
01:05:39,800 --> 01:05:40,480
Infect me!

1708
01:05:40,480 --> 01:05:41,560
Please infect me.

1709
01:05:42,280 --> 01:05:43,480
Infect me, I'm begging you.

1710
01:05:43,480 --> 01:05:44,200
It's not me.

1711
01:05:44,340 --> 01:05:46,480
(Chengcheng's tricks strike again)
Do as I do.

1712
01:05:46,580 --> 01:05:48,240
I'll do as you do.

1713
01:05:48,240 --> 01:05:49,160
That infection move

1714
01:05:49,160 --> 01:05:50,960
(Something feels off)
has no oomph.

1715
01:05:50,960 --> 01:05:52,040
Why don't I feel...

1716
01:05:52,600 --> 01:05:53,900
(Job offer gone wrong)
any sense of responsibility as a killer?

1717
01:05:53,920 --> 01:05:55,640
I've been alone with Jingyu.

1718
01:05:56,120 --> 01:05:57,200
Jingyu really wanted me
to be Killer Zero.

1719
01:05:57,200 --> 01:05:58,280
Jingyu begged him to make a move.

1720
01:05:58,280 --> 01:06:00,760
Bai was running from the moment
he was born.

1721
01:06:00,760 --> 01:06:02,520
Because I couldn't wait to get infected.

1722
01:06:02,520 --> 01:06:04,560
I desperately need a chance
to prove myself.

1723
01:06:04,560 --> 01:06:05,720
We both need a chance

1724
01:06:05,720 --> 01:06:06,840
to prove ourselves.

1725
01:06:06,840 --> 01:06:08,400
Maybe they each have something to prove.

1726
01:06:09,120 --> 01:06:11,120
I just want to redeem myself today.

1727
01:06:11,120 --> 01:06:12,160
There might be a plot twist.

1728
01:06:12,160 --> 01:06:12,840
A twist.

1729
01:06:12,840 --> 01:06:14,160
It's my first day being 33.

1730
01:06:14,160 --> 01:06:16,240
I don't want to clock out so early.

1731
01:06:16,240 --> 01:06:17,720
(Vibey Chat Telephone)

1732
01:06:17,720 --> 01:06:18,520
(Bonus episode preview)
What's bothering you?

1733
01:06:18,520 --> 01:06:20,360
My tonsils have been
a little inflamed lately.

1734
01:06:20,360 --> 01:06:22,240
My dog's been a bit sick lately.

1735
01:06:22,240 --> 01:06:23,000
What's wrong with your dog?

1736
01:06:23,000 --> 01:06:23,880
Tonsillitis.

1737
01:06:25,360 --> 01:06:27,240
Why don't you bring your dog in
so I can take a look?

1738
01:06:27,240 --> 01:06:28,240
It's not really able to go out.

1739
01:06:28,440 --> 01:06:30,320
Was that Xiang Zuo
sitting here just now?

1740
01:06:31,720 --> 01:06:32,840
Apart from turning me
into another species,

1741
01:06:32,840 --> 01:06:33,680
everything else was spot-on.

1742
01:06:33,680 --> 01:06:35,800
Show me the best

1743
01:06:35,800 --> 01:06:38,640
biceps photo you've got!

1744
01:06:38,640 --> 01:06:39,280
Here.

1745
01:06:39,760 --> 01:06:41,800
You've caught my attention, handsome.

1746
01:06:42,680 --> 01:06:44,720
I feel like Bing and Chengcheng

1747
01:06:44,720 --> 01:06:46,080
double-teamed me.

1748
01:06:46,080 --> 01:06:47,360
But Chengcheng's move

1749
01:06:47,360 --> 01:06:48,560
was not that cheesy, really.

1750
01:06:48,560 --> 01:06:49,360
How was that not cheesy?

1751
01:06:49,360 --> 01:06:50,920
Don't act like I'm always like that.

1752
01:06:50,920 --> 01:06:52,800
The game's finally starting.

1753
01:06:52,820 --> 01:06:54,180
(The Vibey Chat Telephone begins soon)

1754
01:06:54,180 --> 01:06:55,340
Guess Who's Breathing.

1755
01:06:55,800 --> 01:06:56,320
Lin.

1756
01:06:57,240 --> 01:06:57,680
Jingyu.

1757
01:06:59,840 --> 01:07:00,320
Huang Jingyu.

1758
01:07:00,380 --> 01:07:01,120
(How did he know?)

1759
01:07:01,120 --> 01:07:02,280
Don't spray so much perfume.

1760
01:07:02,440 --> 01:07:03,920
You know Jingyu by his scent?

1761
01:07:05,520 --> 01:07:07,160
He's done playing a cop.

1762
01:07:07,160 --> 01:07:08,320
Now he's playing a police dog.

1763
01:07:09,660 --> 01:07:10,360
Fan Chengcheng.

1764
01:07:10,700 --> 01:07:11,660
(Confidential)

1765
01:07:12,900 --> 01:07:13,300
Hu.

1766
01:07:13,300 --> 01:07:13,940
(An impromptu orchestra conductor)

1767
01:07:13,940 --> 01:07:14,260
Teng.

1768
01:07:14,860 --> 01:07:15,300
Li Yunrui.

1769
01:07:17,340 --> 01:07:19,060
Is this game messing with me?

1770
01:07:19,460 --> 01:07:20,580
(The first beatdown of autumn
begins soon)

1771
01:07:20,580 --> 01:07:41,820
(Natural High S4 viewing calendar)
